{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本新任農林水產相簗和生繼被揭上任前發表濫權爭議言論後，近日又被指涉嫌違反《公職選舉法》，日本傳媒周三（14日）報道，簗和生向首相高市早苗提出辭職。</p><p>若高市早苗接受，將是其內閣「墮馬」首人。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.543695+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":95,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T10:11:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T07:56:13.993944+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416436+00:00","content_hash":"e0fdfe164fd17d4e8a7435156e6fdde77fd1e3d29f5489c073865c62a9d05d3e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}